{"translation-revision-date":"2025-10-31 00:46:59+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.0.3","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;","lang":"eu_ES"},"Exit fullscreen":["Irten pantaila osotik"],"Toggle fullscreen mode.":["Txandakatu pantaila osoko ikuspegia"],"Create":["Sortu"],"Custom fields":["Eremu pertsonalizatuak"],"Fullscreen mode":["Pantaila oso modua"],"Fullscreen mode deactivated":["Pantaila oso modua desaktibatuta"],"Fullscreen mode activated":["Pantaila oso modua aktibatuta"],"A page reload is required for this change. Make sure your content is saved before reloading.":["Orrialdea berriro kargatzea beharrezkoa da aldaketa hau egiteko. Birkargatu baino lehen egiaztatu ondo gorde duzula dena."],"Get started":["Hasi zaitez"],"Learn how to use the block editor":["Ikasi nola erabili Bloke Editorea"],"All of the blocks available to you live in the block library. You\u2019ll find it wherever you see the <InserterIconImage \/> icon.":["Bloke guztiak erabilgarri dauzkazu Bloke-liburutegian. <InserterIconImage \/>  ikonoa ikusten duzun edozein lekutan aurkituko dituzu."],"Get to know the block library":["Ezagutu Bloke-liburutegia"],"Make each block your own":["Egin bloke bakoitza zurea izatea"],"inserter":["sargailua"],"Welcome to the block editor":["Ongietorri Bloke Editorera"],"In the WordPress editor, each paragraph, image, or video is presented as a distinct \u201cblock\u201d of content.":["WordPressen editorean, paragrafo, irudi, edo bideo bakoitza, eduki \"bloke\" ezberdin baten antzera agertzen da."],"Each block comes with its own set of controls for changing things like color, width, and alignment. These will show and hide automatically when you have a block selected.":["Bloke bakoitza, kolorea, zabalera eta lerrokaduraren antzeko gauzak aldatzeko bere kontrol multzoarekin dator. Hauek automatikoki erakutsi edo ezkutatuko dira blokea hautatzen duzunean."],"Use theme styles":["Erabili itxura estiloak"],"Make the editor look like your theme.":["Editorea zure itxuraren antzerakoa ezarri."],"Welcome Guide":["Ongietorri Gida"],"Welcome to the template editor":["Ongi etorri txantiloi editorera"],"Drag to resize":["Arrastatu berdimentsionatzeko"],"The \"%s\" plugin has encountered an error and cannot be rendered.":["\"%s\" pluginak errore bat aurkitu du eta ezin da errendatu."],"Templates help define the layout of the site. You can customize all aspects of your posts and pages using blocks and patterns in this editor.":["Txantiloiek gunearen diseinua definitzen laguntzen dute. Bidalketen eta orrialdeen alderdi guztiak pertsonaliza ditzakezu editore honetako blokeak eta ereduak erabiliz."],"\"%s\" successfully created.":["\"%s\" ondo sortu da."],"Manage patterns":["Kudeatu ereduak"],"https:\/\/wordpress.org\/documentation\/article\/wordpress-block-editor\/":["https:\/\/wordpress.org\/documentation\/article\/wordpress-block-editor\/"],"My pattern":["Nire eredua"],"Create pattern":["Sortu eredua"],"Fullscreen on.":["Pantaila oso modua aktibatuta."],"Fullscreen off.":["Pantaila oso modua desgaituta."],"pattern (singular)\u0004Synced":["Sinkronizatuta"],"Enter fullscreen":["Sartu pantaila osoan"],"Hide & Reload Page":["Ezkutatu eta Birkargatu Orrialdea"],"Show & Reload Page":["Erakutsi eta Birkargatu Orrialdea"],"Name":["Izena"],"Advanced":["Aurreratua"],"Undo":["Desegin"],"Edit":["Editatu"],"Back":["Atzera"],"Site Icon":["Gunearen ikonoa"]}},"comment":{"reference":"wp-includes\/js\/dist\/edit-post.js"}}